# REVIEW FIX: ha:hasRoleName/ha:RoleName are now ha:hasRoleType/ha:RoleType.
# RDFS uses a controlled role-type resource; the string alternative here requires
# an explicit compatibility decision.
# REVIEW ALIGN: these outgoing contribution links reuse properties whose RDFS
# domain is IntellectualEntity; for example Role hasProducer Person also conflicts
# with the asserted hasProducer range Role. Choose one role-assignment model and
# align domains/ranges and both sets of shapes together. Person/Organization are
# subclasses of Thing, so the Thing branch already accepts arbitrary things;
# remove it where only agents may fill a role.
