# REVIEW ALIGN: height/width are integers here but ha:QuantitativeValue resources
# in RDFS and the File/IntellectualEntity shapes. Select a single measurement model
# or define distinct pixel-dimension properties; a QuantitativeValue currently fails.
# REVIEW FIX: hasRegionDelimX/Y are now ha:hasRegionX/Y with non-negative-integer
# ranges. Update both paths and datatypes so negative coordinates are rejected.
ha:MediaFileShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path ha:hasMimeType ;
        sh:qualifiedValueShape [ sh:datatype xsd:string ; sh:pattern "^(audio|video|image)/.+$" ] ;
        sh:qualifiedMinCount 1 ;
        sh:message "A media file must have an audio, video or image MIME type."@en ;
    ] ;
    sh:targetClass ha:MediaFile ;
     .

